Z||000013||NIFE [PaulV]||12-12-2001||07:42 PM||||The Borla exhaust system now available for all Fieros!!! Introductory price of only $479.00!!! (with Borla tips installed!). They are now in stock and ready to ship! (add UPS cost). To order yours, call Bob Steiger at Twin Lakes Fiero, Paxton, IL. 217-379-9140. Use your Master Card or Visa!  Improve airflow, and add horsepower over the stock Fiero cat-back exhaust system. All 304 aircraft quality stainless system with Borla tips installed has a million mile warranty! This system will be the last system you will ever need to buy for your Fiero! Hanging clamp for spring hanger at cat-out corner bend pre-installed for DIY install. Use your existing hanger clamps to hang at rear. Additional hanging clamps (for springs) included, may need to be welded on for some applications. New OE rear tailpipe hangar clamps for 84-87 cars are available for $18.00 each at time of Borla purchase/shipping. (88 OE rear hangars are currently not available from GM). You can purchase Rodney Dickman's stainless steel clamps for $27.00ea. (all years including 88). Rodney also sells a stainless steel catalytic converter that will have the proper extension piece for the Borla for $112.00. Be sure to specify the converter to match the Borla. See/order these SS clamps & converter items at Rodney's web site: <A HREF="http://www.RodneyDickman.com." TARGET=_blank>www.RodneyDickman.com.</A> <BR>I am posting this for Bob since he does not spend much time on a computer.<BR>||||reg||1
